  "ruleText": "Auc 304.01 License Fees.\n\n(a) The fee for a New Hampshire auctioneer's license shall be $200.00 per 2 year term.\n\nSource. #6658, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12201-B, eff 6-7-17 (from Auc 305.01)",
